#   Dedicated container runtime for canonical Python EOS only; no IAM or
#   infrastructure provisioning authority is conferred by this artifact.
# TENANT POSTURE:
#   Tenant isolation remains fail-closed inside canonical Python EOS authority.
# FAIL-CLOSED POSTURE:
#   Missing runtime configuration, provider authority, database authority, or
#   downstream capability must fail through the application contract rather than
#   being fabricated or silently downgraded.
# FINANCIAL EXECUTION AUTHORITY:
